1
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:10,885
Why’s it so dark? Are all the lights off?

2
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:13,304
You’re not home yet?

3
00:00:16,558 --> 00:00:18,810
Oh my god, you scared me.

4
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,271
Yumi unnie?

5
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:23,898
You’re back?

6
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:26,693
Yeah.

7
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:29,946
But drinking this late...

8
00:00:31,948 --> 00:00:32,615
You too—

9
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,909
You came home late as well.

10
00:00:37,662 --> 00:00:38,413
Ah...

11
00:00:45,503 --> 00:00:47,797
What were you doing out this late?

12
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,426
No, it’s just—

13
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:57,265
- Don’t ever talk about her.

14
00:00:58,266 --> 00:00:59,726
- That’ll just make you think about her more.

15
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:02,812
No.

16
00:01:03,354 --> 00:01:04,939
It just ended up getting late.

17
00:01:12,572 --> 00:01:14,407
“Ended up,” huh.

18
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:20,413
Alright.

19
00:01:23,708 --> 00:01:26,419
Then I’ll wash up and go to bed first.

20
00:02:14,175 --> 00:02:15,426
Gaeun—

21
00:02:16,553 --> 00:02:18,221
Are you asleep?

22
00:02:58,887 --> 00:02:59,470
What?

23
00:03:00,805 --> 00:03:01,890
You’re not sleeping?

24
00:03:04,350 --> 00:03:06,686
How could I? I can’t stop thinking.

25
00:03:09,272 --> 00:03:11,441
Thinking about what?

26
00:03:14,444 --> 00:03:15,445
You.

27
00:03:16,696 --> 00:03:18,823
I can’t stop thinking about you—

28
00:03:19,574 --> 00:03:20,658
It’s driving me crazy.

29
00:03:24,954 --> 00:03:26,080
Honestly—

30
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:29,417
- I can’t stop thinking about you either.

31
00:03:31,336 --> 00:03:32,545
In my head—

32
00:03:35,006 --> 00:03:36,716
I just can’t get you out of it.

33
00:03:40,261 --> 00:03:41,429
What?

34
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,431
Wait—

35
00:03:44,098 --> 00:03:45,391
Are you confessing?
